   "line": [
    "Bxc4"
   ],
   "spoken": "We recapture with the bishop — reaching the famous Isolated Queen's Pawn structure, our lone pawn on d4 with no neighbours on c or e."
  },
  {
   "ply": 12,
   "t": 99,
   "fen": "rn1qkb1r/pp2pppp/5n2/5b2/2BP4/2N5/PP3PPP/R1BQK1NR w KQkq - 1 7",
   "line": [
    "Bf5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Black plays the bishop to f5 — a mistake, and not because of the IQP, but because it leaves two pawns weak and walks into a fork."
